1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:08,775
On larger screens like iPads or Android tablets, PNCC Care automatically transforms into a desktop-grade monitoring dashboard.

2
00:00:08,725 --> 00:00:13,000
On an iPad Pro, it presents an efficient split-view layout.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:24,525
The left pane hosts up to a 4-column grid showing real-time status cards for dozens of seniors at once, while the right pane shows detailed history, timelines, and emergency contacts.

4
00:00:24,525 --> 00:00:33,550
During an emergency, a full-screen dispatch card appears, making it an ideal central command station for nursing homes or community volunteers.

